# Independent review of graph/3.14.kg (origin and definitions of ice, water and gas). Every cited primary file and commit was opened by the reviewer on 2026-11-24.

n: 9.5.19
kind: hub
name: review-of-ice-water-gas-origin
is: Read all 39 claims of 3.14 (21 observations, 18 findings) against their primary files and commits: 30 confirmed, 9 hold only as amended, 0 disputed, 0 left unreviewed; the file has no relayed web node. The amendments: the axioms file does contain the word water; the 2026-06-14 commit that says "The misunderstanding" carries an assistant trailer; the oldest line does not mention compiled code (the answer gas is three days younger); the 2025 node id is an assigned name, not a content identity; the application's lifecycle words are applied to its nodes.
